========================================================================

llvm-mingw has been installed in %%PREFIX%%/llvm-mingw.

To use the cross compiler, add its bin directory to PATH:

  export PATH=%%PREFIX%%/llvm-mingw/bin:$PATH

Then compile, for example:

  x86_64-w64-mingw32-clang hello.c -o hello.exe
  x86_64-w64-mingw32-clang++ hello.cc -o hello.exe

The compiler also accepts the --target= option directly:

  clang --target=aarch64-w64-mingw32 hello.c -o hello.exe

========================================================================
